<title>PHILIPPINES: PHILIPPINE STOCKS - factors to watch - Sept 19.</title>
<headline>PHILIPPINE STOCKS - factors to watch - Sept 19.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are some of the main factors likely to affect Philippine stocks on Thursday:</p>
<p>* On Wednesday, the Dow Jones fell by 11.47 points to 5,877.36. PLDT's ADR gained $1 1/4 to $65 1/2.</p>
<p>* The peso closed at 26.235 to a U.S.dollar from 26.240.</p>
<p>* The Philippine Stock Exchange index closed at 3,248.59, down 11.13.</p>
<p>* The Philippine interbank call loan average rate jumped to 12 percent from 11.71875.</p>
</text>
